  "id": 203715068688120,
  "uuid": "91ddc435-c16c-4326-a1cb-e6a44058f708",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "3b987800-e744-d1c5-72f7-15e426902960",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "15673991-5d7a-ae48-9259-085064f2d8e4",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"AKU-EB is heading in the right direction. Early supplementary results have a positive impact because students can start college with their peers rather than wasting time. Most colleges want complete results, and this system allows them to get that immediately,\" said Tabassum Rana, Principal of Lahore Grammar School. Wajahat Fayyaz, a candidate from Iqra Academy, agreed and added, \"The early results were very beneficial to me. This is the way supplementary exams should be conducted.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Supplementary exams are conducted for two sets of candidates: those who wish to improve some of their previous examination results, and candidates who have failed a particular exam and wish to retake it. AKU-EB's supplementary exams were conducted successfully across Pakistan inKarachi, Lahore, Rawalpindi, Layyah, Gujranwala, Daharki, Mianwali and Gilgit within ten weeks of the end of the annual examination session.This year,45.4per cent of SSC candidates and62.2 per cent of HSSC candidates improved their performance in specific subjects, while41per cent of SSC and HSSC students passed previously failed exams on this attempt.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The supplementary examination results will be made available online at midnight on Thursday, September 17, 2009 at the AKU-EB website ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "https://examinationboard.aku.edu/services/Pages/online-results.aspx",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://examinationboard.aku.edu/services/Pages/online-results.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
