    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Examination Board has announced the results of its supplementary examinations, becoming the first Board of Intermediate and Secondary Education to do so for the 2009 session. AKU-EB's results were announced only 13 days after the end of the examinations. The Board's unique computerised examination and processing system allows students to take full advantage of the ongoing academic year, rather than losing time in the conventionally long wait for supplementary exam results.",
